['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nAt present, there are still a large number of bricklayers, steel bar workers, boiler workers, painters and other types of blue-collar jobs in our country, but under the influence of professional disciplinization, only relevant ones can be found in the professional catalogue of secondary vocational education in our country. and all with a strong discipline color of professional names. These professional names make it difficult for students to match future jobs with the above-mentioned blue-collar jobs, resulting in a big discount for graduates who actually enter the above-mentioned blue-collar jobs.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is intended to be pointed out in this paragraph?\n# Options:\nA) The major catalogue of secondary vocational education in china needs to be adjusted according to the actual post demand.\nB) The professional education of secondary vocational education in china is unable to train students to enter blue-collar posts.\nC) Bricklayer, steel bar worker, boiler worker and other posts are not blue-collar jobs in the traditional sense.\nD) The disconnection between the setting of professional names and the actual educational content makes it difficult for secondary vocational school students to obtain employment.']
