["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nWhen introducing a kind of tea to the guests, a tea dealer said: this kind of tea is produced in Yunshan, and the famous Yunshan tea is produced in Yunshan, so this is authentic Yunshan tea.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is most similar to the dealer's logic when introducing tea?\n# Options:\nA) The students in class 3 are diligent and studious. xiao li is a student in class 3, so xiao li is diligent and studious\nB) The flying brand car is made in a certain country, and the car just now is not a flying brand, so it must not be made in the certain country\nC) All drivers must have a driver's license. xiao zheng has a driver's license, so xiao zheng is the driver\nD) A good doctor needs superb medical skills and noble medical ethics. xiao chen has both, so he is a good doctor"]
