ed by Xiao Li because if Xiao Li hadn't answered, he wouldn't have called anyone else, but he did call Xiao Zhao. Therefore, Xiao Li must have answered Xiao Wang's call. So, option B is correct.\n\nYes, I think that's the correct reasoning.\n"]  5%|▌         | 32/600 [22:22<9:41:15, 61.40s/it] 
