['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThe latest results of the survey on the dietary structure of residents in Province S show that in the past three years, residents in the province have consumed an average of 335.7 grams of cereals and potatoes and miscellaneous beans per day, which is within the range of 250 grams to 400 grams of recommended balanced diet; and 296 grams and 132 grams of vegetables and fruits. Vegetables have only reached the lower limit of the recommended amount of 300 grams to 500 grams per day for a balanced diet. Compared with 10 years ago, the intake has dropped significantly, while fruits only reached the recommended amount. About 16.4 grams of edible fish and shrimp aquatic products, which is much lower than the recommended amount of 50 to 100 grams for a balanced diet; the intake of soy products and dairy products were 16.9 grams and 73.6 grams, respectively, which is lower than the recommended amount and about.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following one can be inferred?\n# Options:\nA) The most popular food for residents in province s is cereals and potatoes and beans.\nB) The average daily consumption of vegetables, cereals, potatoes and beans in province s basically meets the recommended amount of balanced diet.\nC) In the daily life of the residents of province s in the past three years, the average daily consumption of fish and shrimp aquatic products is the least.\nD) The intake of vegetables by the residents of province s is declining year by year.']
