thout knowing how AMT is affecting them, it\'s hard to know what kind of training to offer. So, regular surveys can provide the necessary insights to tailor the training programs better.\n']  8%|▊         | 51/600 [38:42<4:38:20, 30.42s/it]  9%|▊         | 52/600 [38:46<3:23:49, 22.32s/it]
