['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nAn important sign that modern industrial civilization replaces traditional agricultural civilization is that socialized large-scale production replaces traditional small-scale production and natural economy. This is not only the change of the mode of production, but also inherently includes the change of cultural mode. Because the basic principles of the operation mechanism and organization mode of socialized large-scale production are the rational and scientific principles provided by the cultural model of rationalism, as well as the modern organizational principles that embody the rational spirit.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options has the correct understanding of this passage?\n# Options:\nA) Traditional small-scale production and natural economy have made agricultural civilization stagnant for a long time.\nB) The change of the mode of production and the change of cultural mode have promoted the progress of human civilization.\nC) The change of the mode of production and the change of cultural mode have promoted the progress of human civilization.\nD) The transformation of cultural model has fundamentally brought modern industrial civilization to mankind.']
