['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nAdvertising means that for commercial purposes, the commodity operator or service provider bears the cost, through a certain medium or certain form, such as newspapers, television, street signs, shop windows, etc., directly or indirectly promotes the goods or services provided by oneself,Public promotion activities carried out.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is advertising campaigns?\n# Options:\nA) In order to better sell steel, the owner of the steel plant gave a gift of one million to the contractor in the neighboring county\nB) In order to become president, obama did not hesitate to make a speech on tv and newspapers.\nC) The company stipulates that office computers must use a unified brand\nD) Li ning brand clothing sponsored the french sports delegation to go to the olympic games, and obtained good social and economic benefits']
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-01e43a9580aa4024b978cb82ac4ba26c",
