l carved and printed white porcelain,\" which suggests more about the craftsmanship and detail rather than the abstract qualities of beauty, simplicity, and elegance. It doesn't explicitly mention those as the typical style. So D does not match the original text.\n\nTherefore, the answer should be D.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is D) Beauty, simplicity, and elegance are a typical artistic style of ding kiln. \n\n**Answer: D**",
