['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nIncome Gap is big, not necessarily cause social unrest, the key lies in the cause of large gap in what place. By keeping the accounts straight, differences can be avoided and exploitation is no longer possible. In the economic association the muddle-headed account, often becomes the internal friction the reason.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the correct interpretation of this article?\n# Options:\nA) The widening income gap will inevitably lead to the intensification of contradictions\nB) The phenomenon of exploitation is bound to appear in the process of economic communication\nC) Economic disputes are often caused by unclear accounts\nD) The problem of labor income is the decisive factor of social stability']
