hat reason is the most reliable tool for making judgments, which is option A.\n</think>\n\nThe main meaning of the passage is that reason is the most reliable tool for making judgments, especially in complex or critical situations. \n\nAnswer: A) Reason is the most reliable tool for people to make judgments.",
