oth the opportunity and the necessary precautions. However, the main focus is on the trend and the balance they aim to achieve. So, option A is about the trend, which is central, while B, C, D are more about the constraints.\n\nBut wait, the text also mentions that the purpose of applying technology is to improve service levels. So, the main content is about the trend and the balance between technology and service. However, the options don't combine these aspects. Option A is about the trend, which is the main point, while B, C, D are supporting points.\n\nI think the main content is about the trend and the balance, but since the options are separate, the main content is the trend, so A is the main point. Alternatively, the main goal is to improve service quality, which is D. But the text also talks about not sacrificing service and security, which is B. Hmm.\n\nWait, the text starts by saying that the trend is part of the new era, so A is about the trend. Then it discusses the constraints, but the main content is the trend itself. So the main content is A. Alternatively, the main goal is to improve service quality, which is D. But the text also mentions not sacrificing service and security, which is B.\n\nI think the main content is the trend and the balance, but since the options are separate, the main point is the trend, so A. Alternatively, the main goal is to improve service quality, which is D. But the text also mentions not sacrificing service and security, which is B.\n\nWait, the text says that the purpose of applying technology is to improve service levels, so D is about the goal. But the trend is also a main point. I'm a bit confused.\n\nLooking again, the text starts by talking about the trend, then discusses the constraints. So the main content is the trend, so A. But the text also emphasizes the importance of service and security, which is B. So maybe the main content is both A and B, but since the options are separate, I need to choose the main one.\n\nAlternatively, the main content is the trend, so A. But the text also mentions the balance between technology and service, which is more about the goal, which is D. Hmm.\n\nI think the main content is the trend, so A. But I'm not entirely sure. Alternatively, the main point is that banks can't sacrifice service and security, which is B. Or the goal is better service quality, which is D.\n\nWait, the text says that the purpose of applying technology is to improve service levels, so D is the main goal. But the text also mentions the constraints, so maybe the main content is the trend and the balance, but since the options are separate, I think the main content is the trend, so A.\n\nBut I'm not 100% sure. Maybe the main content is the balance between technology and service, which is more about D. Hmm.\n\nI think I'll go with A as the main content because the text starts by highlighting the trend of unmanned banks, which is the main point.\n"] 28%|██▊       | 169/600 [1:49:06<7:36:43, 63.58s/it] 
