oesn\'t seem to be a standard term, and the context doesn\'t use that phrasing. So this might not be the right summary.\n\nD) The potential great value of potatoes needs to be further developed.\n- The context mentions that the potato is a hidden treasure, implying its value is underestimated, but it doesn\'t specifically talk about developing it further. It\'s more about the need to address food security.\n\nSo, the most accurate summary would be option B because it directly addresses the main reason for designating 2008 as the Year of the Potato, which is to highlight its role in solving global food security issues.\n'] 30%|██▉       | 179/600 [1:54:26<2:58:06, 25.38s/it]
