['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nScientists found that men who underwent the same surgery and took the same painkillers experienced less pain relief and were less effective for less time than women.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above text, which of the following is the meaning of expression?\n# Options:\nA) Some painkillers only work on women, not men\nB) Men who took the same painkillers after surgery felt pain more quickly than women\nC) Men are less able to tolerate pain than women\nD) The same painkiller works better for women than for men']
