['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nDirect selling refers to the business mode in which direct selling enterprises recruit sellers to sell products directly to final consumers outside the fixed business place.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is direct selling?\n# Options:\nA) After selecting salesmen, a dairy manufacturer set up 100 sales points in the city to sell dairy products at a unified price.\nB) A bookstore adopts online sales. after customers place an order, the courier will send the products to the designated place and charge a fee.\nC) Some salesmen recruited by a cosmetics brand set up stalls along the road to distribute product descriptions and sell them to customers at lower prices.\nD) At the beginning of school, the new student xiao he bought five table lamps in the wholesale market, one for his own use, and the other four were sold to his classmates.']
