["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nTechnological innovation refers to the first application of a new technology or invention in production and the establishment of a new production or supply function in the production system in the theory of economic development, introduce a new combination of production factors and production conditions. Economics emphasizes that technological innovation has the characteristics of non-exclusiveness, uncertainty, marketability and systemicity.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following behaviors belongs to technological innovation in the field of economics?\n# Options:\nA) In europe, the concorde flew successfully. airfares are extremely expensive because of the high cost of flying.\nB) The space technology of the united states is extremely advanced and the space shuttle flies freely in space.\nC) After a long period of formula testing, wuliangye launched a low alcohol wine on the market and achieved excellent market returns.\nD) Iridium's technology allows people to send and receive messages from anywhere on earth."]
