["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThe role of the microbiome in the Earth's ecosystem and human health is beyond imagination. It will not only greatly help human beings to overcome the survival challenges they face today, but also provide the way for human beings to survive in the future. One reason is that microbes can work together to make themselves more stable and effective in ecosystems and endows the microbiome with more powerful function than single microorganism.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following, if true, best supports this view?\n# Options:\nA) The national microbiome program in the united states is designed to advance the most cutting-edge microbial science in all ecosystems, nature, and man-made worlds.\nB) As a new industry, bio-pesticide and bio-fertilizer have been developing rapidly in recent years and their market share in the world has been increasing rapidly.\nC) The stability and adaptability of the biological system are greatly improved and the degradation efficiency of some harmful compounds is also improved.\nD) A variety of microbial resources are provided in the distillery, from which high efficient cellulose-degrading fungi and high ethanol-producing yeasts can be discovered."] 36%|███▌      | 217/600 [2:30:00<3:39:11, 34.34s/it]
