ne, but it doesn't explicitly state the difference. It's more about the effectiveness rather than the difference itself.\n\nSo, considering all this, option C seems to directly illustrate the meaning of the text because it highlights the magical effects mentioned. Option A is about composition, which is part of the context but not the main point. Option B is about treatment principles, which isn't covered. Option D is about the difference, which is mentioned but not the main point.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is C) Traditional chinese medicine has magical effects.\n\n**Answer:** C",
