['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nIn the process of urbanization in China, traditional opera is facing unprecedented ecological changes. Folk professional performances actively meet the needs of rural entertainment, or restore the traditional folk drama forms, with the help of festival etiquette and customs, give full play to the traditional etiquette and music education function of traditional opera, or keep pace with the times and enrich the opera Noumenon with fashionable and popular artistic elements. to derive a new form of drama entertainment. In the system, professional theatrical troupes carry out artistic inheritance in the process of tradition and innovation, or go deep into the countryside, send plays to the countryside, and still maintain their performances in grass-roots rural areas, or give up rural areas, seek diversified and innovative ways, and try their best to maintain the urban market. as a result, traditional opera tends to be weak and marginal in rural cultural life.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the main content of this text?\n# Options:\nA) The inheritance and development of traditional chinese opera art should seek pluralism and keep pace with the times\nB) Traditional opera is an important carrier to inherit and carry forward the excellent traditional culture\nC) The government should step up its efforts to support the performances of professional theatrical troupes in rural areas\nD) The influence of traditional opera in rural areas shows a trend of polarized development']
