["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nA, B and C traffic police have come to the following conclusion after the safety check of the city's passenger cars during this spring festival: A: all the passenger cars are overloaded. B: there is no overload problem on all the city's passenger buses. C: both Ruyi's and Jixiang's buses are overloaded.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, if only one of the above three conclusions is wrong, which of the following must be true?\n# Options:\nA) A, b, c and ruyi's passenger cars and jixiang's passenger cars are not overloaded.\nB) Both ruyi's passenger cars and jixiang's passenger cars were overloaded.\nC) The passenger cars of ruyi company are overloaded, but the passenger cars of jixiang company are not overloaded.\nD) There is an overloading problem on the passenger cars of jixiang, but there is no overloading problem on the passenger cars of ruyi."]
