["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThe construction workers on the scaffolding, the couriers in the cold wind, the busy restaurant waiters, and the sanitation workers who add luster to the city's construction, there are rivers in the humble bones. Pay attention to these individuals who may be submerged in big words, face up to the solution with feelings, and constantly improve the level of social governance. I believe that in a large country of migrant workers, we can find a more leisurely, safer, more just way to protect their rights and interests, so that they can go to tomorrow with a smile and dignity.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is intended to explain by this passage?\n# Options:\nA) Law is an important weapon for safeguarding rights, and disputes over the rights and interests of migrant workers should be brought into the track of the rule of law\nB) Migrant workers participate in the operating system of social governance\nC) The road of protecting the rights and interests of migrant workers is difficult\nD) From multi-dimensions, omni-directional, the whole process of empowering the group of migrant workers"]
