ost, the argument would be weaker. If the benefits are less, the argument is stronger. So to evaluate that, we need to know if the 1% rejection is actually effective in reducing substandard cheese entering Goronia.\n\nTherefore, option D is the most useful because it directly relates to the effectiveness of the agency's actions, which is central to the argument.\n"] 46%|████▋     | 279/600 [3:05:14<38:36,  7.22s/it]
