['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nAs a result of the recent continuous drought and high temperature, resulting in the city vegetable prices rising, causing the concern of the general public, in order to maintain the interests of the general people, protect the stability of the market, the market price department announced the maximum price of several main vegetables.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options can be derived?\n# Options:\nA) The market economy is not perfect yet\nB) Stability overwhelms ranche\nC) Performance under planned economy system\nD) The price department has state pricing power']
