ses discussed in the paragraph.\n</think>\n\nThe best heading for the paragraph is:\n\n**C) Cause of cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases**\n\nThis option accurately reflects the main points discussed, including the effects of hot weather on heart conditions and related symptoms.",
