e turn of summer and autumn - While prevention is mentioned, the context is about the causes during summer, not specifically targeting prevention strategies at a certain time.\n\nSo the best heading would be option C, as it captures the main causes discussed in the paragraph.\n"] 51%|█████     | 306/600 [3:23:52<1:32:30, 18.88s/it]
