['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nAny paper involving national military, political or economic secrets is not a public paper.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, if the above assertion is true, which of the followings must also be true?\n# Options:\nA) Papers that do not involve national military, political or economic secrets cannot be made public\nB) All unpublic papers are about the national military, political or economic secrets\nC) Some papers involving national military, political or economic secrets can be made public\nD) None of the public papers are involved in national military, political or economic secrets']
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-8b5d1762c16d4341a39ce5c3f69e80fe",
  "object": "text_completion",
