read enough ancient poems. So this could be a point, but I'm not sure if it's the main content.\n\nLooking back, the main idea is about the mutual accommodation between language and emotion, which is option B. The other options are more about the book or the creator's qualities, which are supporting points but not the main content.\n</think>\n\nThe main content of the text is that poetry creation is a process of mutual accommodation between language and emotion. \n\nAnswer: B",
