['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nIf this reform measure is not welcomed by the cadres, we should revise it. If it is not popular with workers, we should adopt a new reform measure. And this measure must be either unpopular with cadres or workers.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, if the above statement is true, which of the followings must be true?\n# Options:\nA) We should revise this reform measure if and only if it does not reduce its reputation among workers.\nB) We should strive to popularize this reform measure among cadres or workers.\nC) If the revision of this reform measure will not affect its popularity among cadres, we should revise it immediately.\nD) If this reform measure is welcomed by the cadres, we should adopt a new reform measure.']
