upported by the context.\n   - **Option B**: Discusses societal stability, which isn't addressed in the context.\n   - **Option C**: Refers to human gregariousness, which isn't part of the context.\n   - **Option D**: Links antler ornaments to ceremonies, which aligns with the context's mention of ceremonial activities.\n\n3. **Conclusion**: Option D best supports the context by connecting antler ornaments to ceremonies, reinforcing the presence of ceremonial activities.\n\nAnswer: D",
