['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nAdministrative agency performance refers to the administrative decision made by the administrative organ according to law requiring the party to perform the obligations of removing obstacles and restoring the original state. If the party fails to perform within the time limit and still fails to perform after being urged, and the consequences have endangered or will endanger traffic safety, cause environmental pollution or damage natural resources, the administrative organ may perform on behalf of the party, or entrust a third party without an interest to perform on behalf of the party\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following options meets the provisions of administrative agent performance:?\n# Options:\nA) An enterprise illegally dumped waste residue, causing water pollution. because it did not have the treatment ability, the local environmental protection bureau designated another enterprise to treat it on its behalf\nB) Safety supervision bureau requires mining enterprises to distribute dust masks. after being urged, the safety supervision bureau shall purchase and distribute dust masks for enterprises that refuse to implement them\nC) A factory was fined by the environmental protection bureau for noise pollution. after being urged, the factory refused to pay the fine, so the environmental protection bureau applied to the court for enforcement\nD) Billboard set up by a store affected driving safety. the urban management department urged the store to remove it within a time limit. if it failed to do so, the urban management department removed it on its behalf']
