han a team. It doesn\'t involve multiple people from different units or regions working together on a project.\n\nOption D: Three friends who are good friends because they share similar experiences and hobbies. This is a personal friendship, not a professional team. They don\'t have a common goal or work on a project together.\n\nSo, based on this analysis, Option A fits the definition of a virtual team because it involves experts from different units using communication tools to work on a common task.\n']
