["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nIn the micro world, neutrinos have always been an omnipresent and unpredictable passer-by. Neutrinos are produced in many ways, such as nuclear reaction in stars, supernova explosion, cosmic ray impact with the earth's atmosphere, and even the decay of rocks and other substances on the earth. Although they may be one of the most common particles in our universe. But because of its strong penetration and almost no interaction with other substances, it is the least known of the basic particles.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is not an accurate understanding of neutrinos?\n# Options:\nA) Neutrinos are ubiquitous in the micro world.\nB) The nuclear reaction inside perseverance is one of the ways to produce neutrinos.\nC) Neutrinos are the most common particles in our universe.\nD) Humans know very little about neutrinos."]
