["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nField dependence means that external references are used as the basis for information processing, so it is difficult to get rid of the influence of environmental factors. Their attitude and self-perception are more easily influenced and disturbed by the people around them, especially the authorities, and they are good at observing words and emotions, paying attention to and remembering the social contents in verbal messages.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following belongs to field dependence?\n# Options:\nA) Have the ability to learn independently\nB) Have one's own opinion on the evaluation of others\nC) Doing things is dominated by intrinsic motivation\nD) Doing things is dominated by external motivation"]
