["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nArson refers to the behavior of deliberately igniting a fire on a condition that one knows that it will cause losses to others, the state and collective property or even threaten the life safety of others.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following acts is arson?\n# Options:\nA) Mr. zhang was dissatisfied with the manager's deduction of the bonus, and he secretly set fire in the manager's kitchen at a night. fortunately, it was found out and he failed.\nB) Mr. li burnt the letter from the other party at home.\nC) Mr. gao was watching a play in the theater and accidentally threw a cigarette butt on the sofa to cause a fire.\nD) Feeling unbearable in this situation, mr. bao was filled with gasoline and set fire to himself in the downtown area."]
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-73bed941d67740b3a2d246e55c1d7d18",
