['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThe scene of the times has changed so much that in order for the younger generation to really remember history, we should not stop at conceptual preaching. A truly complete and effective history education should be integrated into life. It should not only be seen in memorials and in books, It should also infiltrate into the neighborhoods and scenes of our lives in a rich and appropriate form. Only in this way can it be transformed into the collective memory of the whole nation.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is an accurate summary of this passage?\n# Options:\nA) The significance of history education\nB) The form of history education should be lifelike\nC) History education is available anytime, anywhere\nD) History exists in the collective memory of the nation']
