["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThe problems facing Venice are typical.  On the one hand, in order to solve the employment of citizens, increase the economic strength of the city. Its traditional industries must be preserved and developed, which was the basis for economic development that tourism could not replace.  On the other hand, in order to protect its unique ecological environment, industrial pollution must be eliminated, but the development of industry will not be avoided leading to industrial pollution.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options can draw conclusions?\n# Options:\nA) Venice will inevitably face stagnation in economic development or ecological damage\nB) The correct decision of the venice municipal government should be to stop the development of industry in order to protect the ecological environment\nC) The quality of life of the people of venice depends only on the economy and the ecological environment\nD) If one day venice's ecological environment is damaged, it must be the price it pays for economic development"]
