['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nRural culture is a set of contextual production and life experience system, which is determined by the production and living conditions of the society. in any case, the import of advanced culture from the outside to such a society is divorced from reality.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the most accurate understanding of the meaning of contextual in this paragraph?\n# Options:\nA) Adapted to the experience of production and life in various parts of the countryside\nB) Adapting to the actual development and changes in rural areas\nC) Connected with and integrated with the reality of the local rural society\nD) Adapted to the development of advanced culture'] 82%|████████▏ | 490/600 [5:50:35<29:10, 15.91s/it]
