['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThe current income tax rate for domestic and foreign-funded enterprises is 33%. A preferential tax rate of 24% and 15% is applied to some foreign-funded enterprises and 27% to domestic low-profit enterprises. To set the tax rate of the Enterprise income tax Law (draft) at 25% is to reduce the tax burden on domestic enterprises and to control the reduction in fiscal revenue within an affordable range, and to consider the tax rates of the international community, especially those of neighboring countries (regions). The average tax rate of 159 countries (regions) that implement enterprise income tax is 28.6%, while the average tax rate of 18 countries (regions) around China is 26.7%. The new tax rate is moderately low internationally, which is conducive to improving the competitiveness of enterprises and attracting foreign investment.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is the main content of this passage?\n# Options:\nA) New measures of tax rate: from internal and external differences to equal treatment.\nB) A new starting point for enterprises: competition on the same stage and fair competition.\nC) The tax rate of 25% is moderately low internationally.\nD) Adjusting the tax rate will help to improve the competitiveness of enterprises.'] 84%|████████▎ | 502/600 [5:53:02<23:28, 14.38s/it]
