han green spaces.\n\nSo, the only option that doesn't support the conclusion is Option B because it suggests that urban environments, including those near water, make people feel more tired and depressed, which contradicts the belief that water is good for mental and physical health.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is **B**.\n\n**Answer:** B",
