['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nA person from the human resources management department of a company pointed out: due to the limited recruitment positions in our company, it is impossible for all candidates to be hired in this recruitment examination.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following can lead to the above conclusion of the person?\n# Options:\nA) In this recruitment examination, some candidates may be hired\nB) In this recruitment examination, there may be candidates who will not be hired\nC) In this recruitment examination, there are bound to be candidates who will not be hired\nD) In this recruitment examination, there must be candidates to be hired']
