["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThe sandwich layer refers to groups who are unable to buy houses outside of government guarantees and the market.Some of them do not meet the conditions of low-rent housing but have no money to buy affordable houses, and some are not eligible to buy affordable houses but cannot afford commercial houses.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is most likely to be a sandwich layer?\n# Options:\nA) Xiao hu's mother wants to buy a split-level house, while his wife wants to buy another room with a view, xiao hu is caught in the middle\nB) Professor zhang has never bought a house. he believes that buying a house is not as good as renting a house, and renting a house is not as good as borrowing a house\nC) Lao liu used his life savings to buy a second-hand house with three bedrooms and one living room\nD) Xiao li, xiao wang and xiao liu who have just been recruited by the company live in a temporary warehouse of the company"]
