["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nLooking back at the Chinese nation, because of those gleaming colorful poems, the long change of dynasties is no longer monotonous and the Chinese civilization is more and more brilliant. Today, when we are talking about protecting the environment and building ecological civilization, we might as well first feel beauty from ancient poetry and cultivate and improve aesthetic ability. Needless to say, poetry is becoming smaller and smaller and those who can have a deep understanding from it are not in the majority, which cannot be forced. However, through popular packaging, it is undoubtedly a positive energy thing for more people to get close to nature, feel changes and experience the rhythm of life through poetry, so as to appreciate the beauty of nature and give rise to a sense of responsibility to love and protect nature.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is intended to be explained in this paragraph?\n# Options:\nA) The chinese nation has a tradition of loving poetry and caring for nature.\nB) The construction of ecological civilization needs to absorb the nourishment of traditional culture.\nC) Poetry is becoming smaller and smaller and it needs to be packaged in popular form.\nD) The appreciation of ancient poems is helpful to cultivate the public's awareness of environmental protection."]
