ctly states this, so this seems to be a key point.\n\nC) Culture is the ultimate goal of human prosperity and development. The text does say that culture is the ultimate goal, so this is also true.\n\nD) The particularity and importance of cultural industry. The text does talk about the cultural industry's characteristics and its role, so this is true as well.\n\nNow, I need to determine which is the main content. The text starts by describing the cultural industry's characteristics and then discusses its role in future aspects, followed by the emphasis on cultural talents. However, the last sentence directly states the requirement for high quality and scale of cultural talents, which seems to be the central point the text is making. Therefore, option B is the main content.\n</think>\n\nThe main content of the text is that cultural talents should have high quality and scale.\n\nAnswer: B",
