['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nDivergent thinking method is a thinking mode that takes a certain real thing as the starting point, makes full use of the original knowledge and experience, and induces all kinds of strange ideas through imagination, association and analogy.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the followings is not divergent thinking method?\n# Options:\nA) Sun - heating - heat\nB) Wave line - wave - sound\nC) Sweater - cotton wool - fiber\nD) Flowers - children - future']
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-6147631d4db54b7b9581a21caa05f194",
  "object": "text_completion",
  "created": 1750191407,
  "model": "DeepSeekR1-Qwen-7B",
  "choices": [
    {
