['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nWhen you are about to graduate, a certain class will select outstanding graduates, and discussions are ongoing within the class. Class leader: Either Li Xue is rated as an outstanding graduate or Wang Lei is rated as an outstanding graduate. Youth League Party Secretary: I disagree.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following accurately expresses the opinion of the party secretary?\n# Options:\nA) Both li xue and wang lei were rated as outstanding graduates\nB) Neither li xue nor wang lei can be rated as outstanding graduates\nC) Either li xue and wang lei are both rated as outstanding graduates, or neither li xue nor wang lei can be rated as outstanding graduates\nD) Li xue was rated as an outstanding graduate, wang lei cannot be rated as an outstanding graduate']
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-e4b2127cdc4e48dcada71a130e937962",
